    "failure": "Return to owning node only for specific fix/new evidence; unchanged blocked input cannot loop.",
    "delivery": "After rendering, audit the current input and actual preview. Only a pass may produce final output. Revise findings at their owner, change input_version, rerender and reaudit; after three unsuccessful rounds or unchanged blocking evidence, return an explicitly incomplete draft and reasons."
